=Write a short first-touch B2B follow-up draft for this qualified inbound lead.

Name: {{ $json.first_name }}
Company: {{ $json.company }}
Role: {{ $json.job_title }}
Their message: {{ $json.message }}
Lead tier: {{ $json.tier }}
Score: {{ $json.lead_score }}/100

Rules: acknowledge their stated need, do not invent company research, keep it under 120 words, and end with one simple next-step question. This is a draft for human approval, not an automatically sent email.

